{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You're sure you must have misunderstood.][/nomarkup]
{$pcName}: A vampire?
{$sheriff}: Yes ma'am, you heard me right. You're one of us now.
{$kieran}: 'Kindred' is the term we use in sophisticated circles. #line:015f79e
{$sheriff}: Not that it matters to ya now, but at least you know you didn't kill for nothin'. #line:00482a8
{$sheriff}: You were just hungry.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The crazy part is that it makes some amount of sense. Not that it makes you feel any better.][/nomarkup] #line:0d0fe7d
