{$kieran}: I can introduce myself. #line:00c1a47 
{$sheriff}: Sure you can. #line:0d2b8f2 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran sighs, glaring tired daggers at Dominic.][/nomarkup] #line:091e88b  
