title: DropButt
tags:
---
<<if $kevinmurdered == true>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He drops his cigarette butt in the pool of Kevins' blood.. It quenches with a near-silent hiss.][/nomarkup]
<<elseif $coveredinblood == true>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He drops the cigarette butt in the pool of bloody slop from the sink. It quenches with a near-silent hiss.][/nomarkup] 
<<else>>
    {$sheriff}: [nomarkup][He drops the cigarette butt on the ground and quenches it with the heel of his shoe.][/nomarkup]
<<endif>>
{$sheriff}: Reckon this is where our road ends, my friend.
{$sheriff}: Don't think of it as some kinda injustice. Think of it as me makin' sure this nightmare's over 'fore it gets any worse.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran circles the room  around you, but stops to investigate your desk.][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: Ain't no sense draggin' it out. I'll make it quick, swear to ya.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He sighs as he draws his .44 Auto Mag pistol.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][If there ever was a time for self preservation it'd be now.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You try to reach for anything that you can defend yourself with, but Dominic rushes you and pins you by the throat to the fridge.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Behind his sunglasses, he's far too chipper for a man holding a gun to your head.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You hear the safety click, and you close your eyes.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][This is it... In reality, the sound lasts only a second, but it feels like an eternity as you await the shot that ends you for good.][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: Any last words?
{$pcName}: ...
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Before you can speak, Kieran interrupts, staring intently at the documents on your desk.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: Wait a minute, Sheriff. She is not some random fledgling. It appears we barged into the apartment of the journalist who brought down the Pride...
{$sheriff}: [nomarkup][He looks back at Kieran, hand still firm around your neck.][/nomarkup] ... What?
<<if GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Composure","Insight") >= 4>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You can't shake off a feeling that Dominic shows signs of relief for some reason. It's discreet, but it's there. His posture got less tense.][/nomarkup] #line:0f02589
<<endif>>
{$kieran}: She has proven to be very resourceful and insightful in the past. Killing her will only a waste of resources and potential. 
{$kieran}: She managed to put the heat on the Prince. She was also very close to discovering Kindred's existence.
{$kieran}: If we hope to find her sire, let's not waste her talents and use them in this endeavor. Two birds with one stone, so to speak.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Dominic slightly loosens his iron grip, but remains steadfast. His brow furrows, and you can practically see the cogs in his mind beginning to spin.][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: I see why Kate keeps you around, Kieran. You make good points, but Sam would be pissed if she found out I allowed a fledgling loose let alone. Tellin' her name would not make it any easier. 
{$kieran}: Like you stated, she is not experienced in our ways. Tracking her down would not be challenging. Especially now, when we know of her identity and appearance.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He looks straight at you in a way that makes every fibre in your body tighten.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: You will not squander this opportunity by running, correct?
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You nod in agreement. Regardless of whether or not you mean, you know it'd be suicide to refuse.][/nomarkup] 
{$kieran}: Should she prove herself to be capable, the Praxis will surely find a place for someone who is capable in the art of investigation. Even you cannot deny that - given your role.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Dominic stays silent for a few moments before his cheeky smile returns; he sighs, shakes his head and takes a step back. He drops you to the floor.][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: You win this one. But that girl's your mess to clean up. Come hell or high water, you stick together. I just hope whatever you're after's worth all this blood and noise. #line:04eea9b 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran blinks several times. You hope he doesn't regret his choice.][/nomarkup] 
{$kieran}: Understood.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Dominic grins, showing nearly all his teeth in satisfaction.][/nomarkup] 
-> {$pcName}: Thanks, I guess. #line:0f24878 
    {$sheriff}: That's the spirit.
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He pats you on the arm - like you're his best friend. It makes you feel even more uncomfortable.][/nomarkup]
    {$sheriff}: It ain't me you oughta be thankin' though. 
-> {$pcName}: I'm nobody's pet. #line:0df7461 
    {$sheriff}: I think you might be, darlin'. Think whatever you want, but better behave unless you wanna be put down like a rabid dog.
{$sheriff}: But I do have one condition - can't be goin' home to my wife knowin' I've gone and broken too many Traditions. Can't have the rabble thinkin' I'm handin' out hall passes like hotcakes.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He lowers his sunglasses slightly and you see his eyebrows rise over their rims, a serious look on his face.][/nomarkup] #line:08fe248
{$sheriff}: You need to find your Sire. Tonight. We clear?
{$pcName}: That's impossible! I don't even remember where I was last night. #line:0df954f 
{$kieran}: ... I'm sure we will find some way to manage.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He says, looking at you.][/nomarkup] #line:05082d0 
{$sheriff}: Well... hate to tell ya, but that ain't my problem. Still, looks like you've got yourself a shot, don't ya? Best give some thanks to your new best friend. [nomarkup][He grins again at Kieran.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He takes a deep breath, attempting to compose himself once more.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: ... We will start with the basics. I am sure that the answer to our question is around here somewhere.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Dominic taps his foot a couple of times, glancing at the ground. The spurs of his cowboy boots jingle lightly in response.][/nomarkup] 
{$sheriff}: Can't be tellin' ya how to do your job — that'd be downright unethical. 'Sides, you got Desiree here, and you hold her in such high regard. Be plain rude of me to step in, wouldn't it? 
{$sheriff}: Besides, I get a kick outta watchin' Kieran squirm at the notion he might not see evenin' lights again.
{$sheriff}: But I'll give ya a clue. Free o' charge. Don't go gettin' used to it, though.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][In a flash, he pulls out a knife and cuts your palm open. Thick, dark blood slowly leaks out.][/nomarkup]
{$pcName}: Ow! #line:00955f7 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He grips your hand and slurps up a glob of blood. As his tongue makes contact with the slash, it seals before your eyes.][/nomarkup]
<<if $brujah == true>>
    {$sheriff}: [nomarkup][He looks like a wine taster savoring your blood.][/nomarkup]
    {$sheriff}: Ah, 'course you're a Brujah. #line:0af945a 
<<endif>> 
{$pcName}: What's that supposed to mean? #line:0dc424c 
{$kieran}: Similar to how humans have ethnicities, Kindred have certain... classifications applicable to us. We call them Clans.
{$kieran}: You come from an ancient bloodline of Kindred known for their... strong convictions. #line:0efa0eb 
{$sheriff}: Guess it ain't your fault you're the kinda trouble only a sire could love. #line:06773aa 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Coming from this guy, of all people...][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: Heh... judge by the strength o' your blood, your sire ain't small potatoes. Good luck - you're both gonna need it #line:073f51b 
{$sheriff}: I'm off. I'll have a team swing by to clean up soon. Pleasure meetin' you, Desiree. I'll be in touch.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He lowers his shades a bit and winks.][/nomarkup]  #line:079d346 
<<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_MAIN_SATURDAY_START" "TAKE_COVER">>
{$kieran}: Well then. 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][His breath takes a short halt as he is looking at his watch.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: We are on the clock, miss Bardot. We have approximately nine hours, so let's make the best of it. 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He looks back up at you.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: Be blunt with me; we cannot afford insincerity. I wish to solve your problem as much as you do. Do you remember anything, whatsoever, from the last 24 hours? #line:0ba7936 
-> {$pcName}: I wish I did. #line:0c089cd 
    {$kieran}: That makes two of us. Sadly, it does not help us, either. #line:0f914a5 
-> {$pcName}: I woke up. #line:0dfd727 
    {$kieran}: Not unlike several thousands of people and Kindred in the Valley. #line:00a5116 
{$kieran}: Please, attempt to reconstruct recent events with me, miss Bardot. This is your flat, correct? Recall your most recent memory of this place before today.
{$kieran}: Is there anything that is here and was not before? Anything missing or different, and if so, can you name it? Aside from the dead people, of course. #line:0b61e19 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You rub your temple. The clinical tone of the questions is not dissimilar to the kind of prodding inquiry one would receive in therapy.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Sadly, you seem to come up short - no matter how hard you try. You sigh and shake your head.][/nomarkup]	 #line:020d9cc 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He stares at you, analyzing your every move.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: Nothing? That's alright... One's memory may be feeble at times - especially if the event one is remembering is traumatizing. Next, we should search the apartment. Perhaps something will jog your mind. #line:0fd0013 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Before the conversation comes to an end, you feel the need to say one last thing.][/nomarkup] #line:097de2e 
-> {$pcName}: Thanks for saving me. #line:095235a 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He raises his head a bit.][/nomarkup] 
    {$kieran}: This is not sympathy, so please do not take it as such. My good will extends only as far as your resolve. (+1 Kieran Influence) #line:07a4702
    <<ModifyInfluence 1 {$kieran}>> 
-> {$pcName}: So you're my jailor. #line:0cebb89 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He crosses his arms, glaring at you coldly.][/nomarkup] 
    {$kieran}: That would imply I will come out of this ordeal unscathed should you fail, and I believe Dominic made himself clear: you are my responsibility now. #line:03eb161 
    <<ModifyInfluence -1 {$kieran}>> 
{$pcName}: Why did you do it, then, if you knew the risks? #line:0d89e29 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He looks at you intently for several seconds - trying to gather his thoughts.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: It seems we may have a chance to emerge from this predicament unscathed. We merely need to continue moving. 
<<if GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Wits","Insight") >= 3>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He's trying to avoid answering - acknowledging the fact that he didn't expect this to happen.][/nomarkup] #line:0aa1e4e 
<<elseif GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Wits", "Insight") >= 4>>    
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He miscalculated, and he's ashamed of that fact.][/nomarkup]  #line:094d354 
<<endif>>
{$pcName}: That doesn't answer my question. #line:0c48e22 
{$kieran}: I know. But it will have to suffice. For now. #line:045022a
-> [nomarkup][End conversation.][/nomarkup] 
